{\*\ftnsep\chftnsep}\pgnucrm\pard\plain \s1\sb240\sa120\rtlch\afs36\ab\ltrch\fs36\b{\listtext\pard\plain }\ilvl0\ls1 \fi0\li0\lin0\sl360\slmult1\qj\fi0\li0\lin0\sb240\sa120\ltrpar{\f5
{\*\bkmkstart __RefHeading___Toc2692_2421919870}{\*\bkmkend __RefHeading___Toc2692_2421919870}A hivatal, amely nem l\u233\'e9tezett}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi egy reggel arra \u233\'e9bredt, hogy levelet kapott.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A bor\u237\'edt\u233\'e9kon csak ennyi \u225\'e1llt:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
\u201\'c9RTES\u205\'cdT\u201\'c9S}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Felbontotta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A lev\u233\'e9l szerint egy bizonyos hivatal meg\u225\'e1llap\u237\'edtotta r\u243\'f3la, hogy \u233\'e9vek \u243\'f3ta valamilyen k\u252\'fcl\u246\'f6nleges elj\u225\'e1r\u225\'e1s szerint \u233\'e9l.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi nem eml\u233\'e9kezett ilyen hivatalra.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A lev\u233\'e9l azonban hivatalosnak t\u369\'3fnt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
D\u225\'e1tum volt rajta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u220\'dcgysz\u225\'e1m.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
B\u233\'e9lyegz\u337\'3f.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Al\u225\'e1\u237\'edr\u225\'e1s.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A lap alj\u225\'e1n pedig egy mondat:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
\u8222\'84}{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
Az \u233\'e9rintettnek a tov\u225\'e1bbiakban fokozott figyelemmel kell elj\u225\'e1rnia.\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi sok\u225\'e1ig n\u233\'e9zte.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n elrakta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
M\u225\'e1snap \u250\'fajabb lev\u233\'e9l \u233\'e9rkezett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ez\u250\'fattal azt k\u246\'f6z\u246\'f6lt\u233\'e9k vele, hogy bizonyos dolgokat helyesen csin\u225\'e1lt, m\u225\'e1sokat viszont helytelen\u252\'fcl.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A lev\u233\'e9l nem r\u233\'e9szletezte, melyeket.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi ez\u233\'e9rt elkezdett figyelni.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Megfigyelte, hogyan kel fel.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Mit gondol reggel.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Milyen szavakat haszn\u225\'e1l.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Hogyan \u252\'fcl.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Mikor csendes.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Mikor besz\u233\'e9l.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
N\u233\'e9h\u225\'e1ny h\u243\'f3nap m\u250\'falva m\u225\'e1r k\u252\'fcl\u246\'f6n f\u252\'fczetet vezetett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A c\u237\'edme ez volt:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
\u218\'daTMUTAT\u211\'d3}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az els\u337\'3f oldalra ezt \u237\'edrta:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Hogyan kell helyesen \u233\'e9lni?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A m\u225\'e1sodikra:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Milyen \u233\'e9rz\u233\'e9s, amikor j\u243\'f3l csin\u225\'e1lom?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A harmadikra:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Mit kell gondolnom ahhoz, hogy a dolgok rendben legyenek?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A k\u233\'e9rd\u233\'e9sekhez id\u337\'3fvel v\u225\'e1laszokat is tal\u225\'e1lt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem tudta, honnan.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Tal\u225\'e1n k\u246\'f6nyvekb\u337\'3fl.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Tal\u225\'e1n m\u225\'e1s emberekt\u337\'3fl.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Tal\u225\'e1n saj\u225\'e1t mag\u225\'e1t\u243\'f3l.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A v\u225\'e1laszokat mindenesetre le\u237\'edrta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ha rossz napja volt, elolvasta \u337\'3fket.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ha f\u233\'e9lt, megism\u233\'e9telte \u337\'3fket.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ha bizonytalan volt, elk\u233\'e9pzelt egy jobb napot.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ha valami nem \u250\'fagy t\u246\'f6rt\u233\'e9nt, ahogy szerette volna, megpr\u243\'f3b\u225\'e1lta m\u225\'e1sk\u233\'e9pp elk\u233\'e9pzelni.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy id\u337\'3f ut\u225\'e1n m\u225\'e1r eg\u233\'e9sz j\u243\'f3l ment neki.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Legal\u225\'e1bbis ezt gondolta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n egy reggel megint lev\u233\'e9l \u233\'e9rkezett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A bor\u237\'edt\u233\'e9kon ugyanaz a sz\u243\'f3 \u225\'e1llt:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
\u201\'c9RTES\u205\'cdT\u201\'c9S}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Felbontotta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egyetlen mondat volt benne:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
\u8222\'84}{\cs24\rtlch\ab\ltrch\hich\af5\ab\dbch\ab\loch\f5\b
Az elj\u225\'e1r\u225\'e1s megsz\u369\'3fnt.\u8221\'94}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi megijedt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem att\u243\'f3l, hogy megsz\u369\'3fnt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Hanem att\u243\'f3l, hogy nem tudta, mi volt az elj\u225\'e1r\u225\'e1s.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
El\u337\'3fvette az \u246\'f6sszes kor\u225\'e1bbi levelet.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egym\u225\'e1s mell\u233\'e9 rakta \u337\'3fket az asztalon.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
D\u225\'e1tum szerint rendezte.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Megn\u233\'e9zte a b\u233\'e9lyegz\u337\'3fket.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az al\u225\'e1\u237\'edr\u225\'e1sokat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az \u252\'fcgysz\u225\'e1mokat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n \u233\'e9szrevette, hogy valami furcsa.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az \u246\'f6sszes lev\u233\'e9len ugyanaz a k\u233\'e9z\u237\'edr\u225\'e1s szerepelt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az \u246\'f6v\u233\'e9.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi h\u225\'e1trad\u337\'3flt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Sok\u225\'e1ig nem mozdult.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n el\u337\'3fvette az \u218\'daTMUTAT\u211\'d3 c\u237\'edm\u369\'3f f\u252\'fczetet.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Lapozni kezdett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az els\u337\'3f oldal:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Hogyan kell helyesen \u233\'e9lni?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A m\u225\'e1sodik:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Milyen \u233\'e9rz\u233\'e9s, amikor j\u243\'f3l csin\u225\'e1lom?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A harmadik:}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8222\'84}{\f5
Mit kell gondolnom ahhoz, hogy a dolgok rendben legyenek?\u8221\'94}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi hirtelen nevetni kezdett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem hangosan.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Csak \u250\'fagy, ahogy az ember akkor nevet, amikor r\u225\'e1j\u246\'f6n, hogy valami nagyon komoly dolgot nagyon komolyan vett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u252\'fczetet becsukta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Aznap nem \u237\'edrt bele semmit.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
D\u233\'e9lut\u225\'e1n elment s\u233\'e9t\u225\'e1lni.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az utc\u225\'e1n minden ugyanolyan volt, mint el\u337\'3fz\u337\'3f nap.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az emberek siettek.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy busz elment mellette.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Valahol egy ablakot becsuktak.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy kutya ugatott.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi meg\u225\'e1llt egy kirakat el\u337\'3ftt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A kirakatban egy \u252\'fcres poh\u225\'e1r \u225\'e1llt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem tudta, mi\u233\'e9rt van ott.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem volt hozz\u225\'e1 magyar\u225\'e1zat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem volt felirat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem volt t\u246\'f6rt\u233\'e9net.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Csak egy \u252\'fcres poh\u225\'e1r.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi n\u233\'e9zte.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy ideig arra gondolt, hogy biztosan jelent valamit.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n arra gondolt, hogy tal\u225\'e1n \u337\'3f jelent\u233\'e9st akar adni neki.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n arra gondolt, hogy tal\u225\'e1n egyik sem fontos.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Tov\u225\'e1bbment.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Este otthon megszomjazott.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
El\u337\'3fvette a poharat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Megn\u233\'e9zte.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u220\'dcres volt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Megt\u246\'f6lt\u246\'f6tte v\u237\'edzzel.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem az\u233\'e9rt, mert ez valamit jelentett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem az\u233\'e9rt, mert ett\u337\'3fl jobb ember lett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem az\u233\'e9rt, mert a vil\u225\'e1g \u252\'fczent neki.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Csak mert szomjas volt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Amikor ivott, meg\u233\'e9rezte, hogy a v\u237\'edz hideg.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Ez volt minden.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi letette a poharat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
M\u225\'e1snap nem \u233\'e9rkezett lev\u233\'e9l.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Harmadnap sem.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy h\u233\'e9t m\u250\'falva sem.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy h\u243\'f3nap m\u250\'falva a f\u233\'e9rfi m\u225\'e1r nem v\u225\'e1rta \u337\'3fket.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az \u218\'daTMUTAT\u211\'d3 c\u237\'edm\u369\'3f f\u252\'fczetet megtartotta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem haszn\u225\'e1lta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy nap a fia megtal\u225\'e1lta a polcon.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Mi ez?}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi r\u225\'e1n\u233\'e9zett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Egy r\u233\'e9gi \u250\'fatmutat\u243\'f3.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Mihez?}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi elmosolyodott.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Nem tudom.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Akkor mi\u233\'e9rt tartod meg?}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi levette a polcr\u243\'f3l.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Kinyitotta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az utols\u243\'f3 oldalon egyetlen \u252\'fcres lap volt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Sok\u225\'e1ig n\u233\'e9zte.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n becsukta.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Mert n\u233\'e9ha j\u243\'f3 eml\u233\'e9kezni arra, hogy nem minden \u250\'fatmutat\u243\'f3 vezet valahov\u225\'e1.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A fi\u250\'fa nem \u233\'e9rtette.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Akkor mi vezet?}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi v\u225\'e1llat vont.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Nem tudom.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Kimentek a konyh\u225\'e1ba.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A fi\u250\'fa megl\u225\'e1tta a poharat.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Ez \u252\'fcres.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Igen.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Megt\u246\'f6ltsem?}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi r\u225\'e1n\u233\'e9zett.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u8211\'96 }{\f5
Ha szomjas vagy, magadnak t\u246\'f6lts.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A fi\u250\'fa elmosolyodott.}
\par \pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A f\u233\'e9rfi is.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Azt\u225\'e1n mindketten ott hagyt\u225\'e1k a poharat az asztalon.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Egy ideig \u252\'fcresen.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Nem t\u246\'f6rt\u233\'e9nt semmi.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
\u201\'c9s tal\u225\'e1n \u233\'e9ppen ez\u233\'e9rt volt j\u243\'f3.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
K\u233\'e9s\u337\'3fbb a f\u233\'e9rfi arra gondolt, hogy tal\u225\'e1n eg\u233\'e9sz \u233\'e9let\u233\'e9ben azt hitte, valahol l\u233\'e9tezik egy hivatal, amely pontosan tudja, hogyan kell \u233\'e9lni.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Most el\u337\'3fsz\u246\'f6r jutott esz\u233\'e9be, hogy tal\u225\'e1n soha nem volt ilyen hivatal.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
De nem \u233\'e9rezte sz\u252\'fcks\u233\'e9g\u233\'e9t annak, hogy ezt bizony\u237\'edtsa.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Aznap este nem keresett v\u225\'e1laszt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Csak kin\u233\'e9zett az ablakon.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Az utca ugyanaz volt.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A h\u225\'e1zak ugyanazok.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
A l\u225\'e1mp\u225\'e1k ugyan\u250\'fagy vil\u225\'e1g\u237\'edtottak.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Semmi nem v\u225\'e1ltozott.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\ltrpar{\f5
Csak \u337\'3f nem pr\u243\'f3b\u225\'e1lta t\u246\'f6bb\u233\'e9 eld\u246\'f6nteni, mit jelent.}
{\f5\par}\pard\plain \s26\sl276\slmult1\sb0\sa140\sl360\slmult1\qj\sb0\sa0\ltrpar{\f5
\u201\'c9s valami\u233\'e9rt ett\u337\'3fl az eg\u233\'e9sz egy kicsit t\u225\'e1gasabb lett.}
{\f5\par}}